{"seq":3,"slug":"persistent-world-state","title":"世界状态持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/continuity/persistent-world-state","wordCount":1457,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"世界状态持久化\">世界状态持久化</h1><p>玩家在一座村庄里推倒了一摞箱子、点燃了篝火、捡走了桌上的钥匙，然后走远，这片 cell 被卸载。十分钟后他折返——箱子若又整齐立着、篝火又熄了、钥匙又躺回桌上，世界就「失忆」了，沉浸感瞬间崩塌。这一篇处理「逻辑裂缝」：cell 在卸载与重载之间，玩家造成的运行时变更怎样保住。它和存档是近亲，但只管一个很窄的口子——卸载/重载之间的状态保活。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>cell 卸载会把里面的 Actor 全部销毁、内存归还（见 <a href=\"../streaming/unloading-memory\">卸载与内存预算</a>）。问题是：原始 cell 资源是只读的「出厂状态」，玩家的改动只活在那些被销毁的 Actor 实例里。要让改动存活，必须在销毁前把「改动」从「实例」里<strong>摘出来、单独存好</strong>，重载时再「灌回去」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[出厂状态&lt;br/&gt;cell 原始资源 只读] --&gt; B[加载: 实例化 Actor]&#10;    B --&gt; C[玩家交互&lt;br/&gt;推箱/捡物/破坏]&#10;    C --&gt; D{cell 要卸载}&#10;    D --&gt; E[卸载前: 摘出增量&lt;br/&gt;diff vs 出厂状态]&#10;    E --&gt; F[存入持久状态层&lt;br/&gt;按实体ID 索引]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Actor 销毁 内存归还]&#10;    G --&gt; H{玩家折返 cell 重载}&#10;    H --&gt; I[实例化出厂 Actor]&#10;    I --&gt; J[回灌增量&lt;br/&gt;覆盖出厂状态]&#10;    J --&gt; K[世界记得玩家做过什么]\">flowchart TD\n    A[出厂状态&lt;br/&gt;cell 原始资源 只读] --&gt; B[加载: 实例化 Actor]\n    B --&gt; C[玩家交互&lt;br/&gt;推箱/捡物/破坏]\n    C --&gt; D{cell 要卸载}\n    D --&gt; E[卸载前: 摘出增量&lt;br/&gt;diff vs 出厂状态]\n    E --&gt; F[存入持久状态层&lt;br/&gt;按实体ID 索引]\n    F --&gt; G[Actor 销毁 内存归还]\n    G --&gt; H{玩家折返 cell 重载}\n    H --&gt; I[实例化出厂 Actor]\n    I --&gt; J[回灌增量&lt;br/&gt;覆盖出厂状态]\n    J --&gt; K[世界记得玩家做过什么]</pre><p>关键设计是<strong>只存增量（delta），不存全量</strong>：cell 里 99% 的东西没被碰过，存全量既浪费又和出厂资源重复。只记录「相对出厂状态的差异」，是持久化能在大世界里扩展的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量状态-只记被改过的东西\">增量状态：只记被改过的东西</h2><p>设一个 cell 的出厂状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（只读，存在资源里），玩家交互后的当前状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，则需要持久化的只有差异：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⊖</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = S \\ominus S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>重载时由出厂状态加增量重建：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = S_0 \\oplus \\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。增量的典型条目分几类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>增量类型</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>存储内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>属性变更</td>\n<td>门开了、宝箱空了、机关触发</td>\n<td>实体ID + 变更字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体删除</td>\n<td>敌人被杀、资源被采集</td>\n<td>实体ID + 删除标记（墓碑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体新增</td>\n<td>玩家放置的建筑、掉落物</td>\n<td>完整实体描述（无出厂对应）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变换变更</td>\n<td>箱子被推到新位置</td>\n<td>实体ID + 新 transform</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套设计要求每个可持久化实体有一个<strong>跨会话稳定的 ID</strong>——不能用内存指针或加载顺序，必须是编辑期分配、随出厂资源一起存的稳定标识（UE 的 OFPA 让每个 Actor 有稳定 GUID，恰好天然适配，见 <a href=\"../foundations/world-partitioning\">世界分区</a>）。删除用「墓碑」标记而非真删条目，否则重载时出厂实体又会冒出来。增量按实体 ID 索引，重载时遍历出厂 Actor、查增量表、命中就覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"持久状态层-存在哪-活多久\">持久状态层：存在哪、活多久</h2><p>增量摘出来后要有个家。这个<strong>持久状态层</strong>独立于 cell 资源，按 cell 或区域分桶，常驻内存或落盘，生命周期比 cell 长得多。它要回答两个问题：粒度多大、保留多久。</p>\n<p>粒度上，全图所有改动堆一张表会越玩越大、查询越慢，所以按 cell/区域分桶——卸载 cell A 时只动 A 的增量桶，重载时只查 A 的。保留期上，并非所有改动都该永久记：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>永久</strong>：剧情相关（任务里炸掉的桥、解锁的门）——必须一直记到存档。</li>\n<li><strong>会话级</strong>：战斗痕迹、临时破坏——记到本次游戏会话，重启可重置。</li>\n<li><strong>临时/可遗忘</strong>：散落的弹壳、踩出的脚印——可设过期时间或数量上限，超了就丢最老的（LRU），避免无限膨胀。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套分级让持久化在「世界记得玩家」和「内存不爆」之间平衡。被卸 cell 的临时实体重建常借 <a href=\"../streaming/unloading-memory\">卸载与内存预算</a> 的对象池——从池里取一个再灌增量，比从磁盘重载快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与存档的边界-保活-vs-落盘\">与存档的边界：保活 vs 落盘</h2><p>这一篇最容易和存档混淆，必须划清。<strong>本篇只管「运行时、内存里、卸载与重载之间」的状态保活</strong>；把这些状态序列化进存档文件、做格式演进、增量快照、防损坏，是 <a href=\"../game-save-serialization/\">存档与序列化</a> 的事。两者的接力关系是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>本篇（持久化保活）</th>\n<th>存档系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发时机</td>\n<td>cell 卸载/重载</td>\n<td>玩家存档 / 自动存档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储介质</td>\n<td>内存（可溢出到盘）</td>\n<td>磁盘文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td>本次游戏会话内</td>\n<td>跨启动、跨设备（云存档）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关心</td>\n<td>摘增量、回灌、ID 稳定</td>\n<td>字节格式、压缩、加密、损坏恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据形态</td>\n<td>同一套增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的序列化快照</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>二者共享同一套增量数据结构 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>——这正是接口干净的地方：持久状态层维护内存里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，存档时把当前所有桶的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 交给存档系统序列化落盘；读档时存档系统把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 还原进持久状态层，后续 cell 重载就能回灌。存档侧的大世界增量快照与对象图引用，详见 <a href=\"../../game-save-serialization/techniques/snapshot-vs-delta\">存档与序列化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持久化处理「逻辑裂缝」：cell 卸载会销毁 Actor，必须在销毁前把玩家造成的运行时变更摘出存好，重载时回灌，否则世界失忆。</li>\n<li>只存增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⊖</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = S\\ominus S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（相对出厂状态的差异），不存全量——大世界里 99% 的东西没被碰过，这是可扩展的前提。</li>\n<li>增量分属性变更/删除（墓碑）/新增/变换四类，依赖每个实体跨会话稳定的 ID（OFPA 的 GUID 天然适配）。</li>\n<li>持久状态层按 cell 分桶、独立于资源、生命周期更长，改动按永久/会话级/临时分级保留，临时项用 LRU/过期防膨胀。</li>\n<li>与存档划清边界：本篇只管运行时内存里的保活，落盘/格式/损坏恢复归存档系统；两者共享同一套 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 数据结构作为干净接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>cell 卸载销毁与对象池重建：<a href=\"../streaming/unloading-memory\">卸载与内存预算</a></li>\n<li>实体稳定 ID 的来源（OFPA GUID）：<a href=\"../foundations/world-partitioning\">世界分区</a></li>\n<li>大跳变（传送）时的状态一致性：<a href=\"seamless-transitions\">无缝接缝</a></li>\n<li>跨库——增量快照的序列化落盘：<a href=\"../../game-save-serialization/techniques/snapshot-vs-delta\">存档与序列化 · 快照与增量</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"世界状态持久化","id":"世界状态持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"增量状态：只记被改过的东西","id":"增量状态-只记被改过的东西"},{"level":2,"text":"持久状态层：存在哪、活多久","id":"持久状态层-存在哪-活多久"},{"level":2,"text":"与存档的边界：保活 vs 落盘","id":"与存档的边界-保活-vs-落盘"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"HLOD 与 Impostor","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/continuity/hlod-imposters"},"next":{"title":"开放世界制作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/practice/open-world-authoring"}}